Editor's Note
=============
As of this month's posting, the OpenVMS FAQ has been split into three parts.
The primary motivation for this was that INFO-VAX subscribers have not been
receiving the FAQ for many months, and I am fairly certain this is due to
the size (107KB) of the FAQ.  That the FAQ has grown this large is a tribute
to the active submissions by the readership, but it may cause problems for
some mailers.  I hope that the split will allow the FAQ to be more 
palatable to mailer software.

The versions on ftp.digital.com and CompuServe will still be one file,
for now.  Also, this edition is NOT cross-posted to comp.answers and 
news.answers (and thus won't appear at rtfm.mit.edu) as the split format
requires approval by the *.answers moderators (requested, not yet received.)

If you received this through the INFO-VAX mailing list, please read and save
the instructions in sections INTRO4 and INTRO5.

