Welcome to UNIX!
conio.h is a DOSism. It was never a standard C-header file. Terminal
(screen) acces is much different in Unix. You might want to try the
termlib library, termcap or curses.

Hope this helps,

   Wolfram

BTW, if you understand German or have a friend who does, there is a
German Unix magazine called IX, which had an article about porting DOS
programs to UNIX a few isuues ago. This article addressed exactly this
conio.h problem as far as I remember. Try www.heise.de, which is the
publishers WWW server. 

