Ok... Heres your problem... When you installed the 2nd disk controller the
vectors moved. Everything but the Dhv11 float (I bevlive...). You will have to
change the verctor(s) to what VMS whats it to be.

If you bring the system up Min and go into sysgen you can add all the devices
and check for the vectors.

Also this shouldn't make much differance, but the disk controllers should be the
last cards on the bus.

