In <philnaz-1408962215030001@pm2-10.dialup.webspan.net>, philnaz@webspan.net (Phil Nasadowski) writes:

>Nevertheless, the is NO such thing as a Winchester (note lack of quotes)
>drive - it's a common nickname for hard drives (patterened after the
