If I remember correctly, when playing with our box I found that if the 
keyboard is unplugged, the system will automatically switch over to the 
serial port.  However, it is a DB9 serial port, not a DB15. (Right below 
the keyboard connector.)

Also, if you are making serial cables, you need to connect ground as well 
as TX and RX.  That is, you need at least 3 wires.

I found it easiest to use a standard PC 25 pin to 9 pin converter with a 
standard 25 pin serial cable.

