From: Martyn Richard Jones <martyn1@ibm.net>
Subject: DW: A newer form of alchemy
Date: 1996/08/02
Message-ID: <32023924.5380@ibm.net>
X-Deja-AN: 171533959
content-type: text/plain; charset=iso-8859-1
organization: Iniciativa para Data Warehouse
mime-version: 1.0
