Controller based from Digital 

RAID 0  - striping
RAID 1  - Mirroring ( or as VMS users refer to it shadowing ).
RAID 0 + 1 - Mirroring + striping
RAID 5

on controllers such as the HSJ40s.


Host based from Digital 

RAID 0  - striping
