from SRM?  I blew away the ARC image (Didn't have enough ROM blocks to
fit all images on my EB164.) in order to fit MILO, but there doesn't
seem to be an obvious way to switch directly from SRM to MILO.  The
only way that I've been able to accomplish this is to SRM --> Debug
--> Milo, and that seems rather awkward.

